{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:12:34.714998+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Thank you for the opportunity. A strong in-house team is a critical asset, and our service is designed to augment, not replace, such talent.\n\nEven the most capable teams can find their analyst bandwidth stretched thin during periods of high deal flow. We provide flexible, supplemental capacity for due diligence, allowing your core analysts to focus on the highest-conviction opportunities while ensuring other promising deals are vetted without creating a backlog. Our analysis is based on our proprietary 6-Pillar DD Framework.\n\nThis leads me to wonder, how does your team currently manage the pipeline and prioritize deals when your primary research staff is already at its limit?"}
