{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:12:56.186284+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "Acknowledged. A strong in-house team is a significant advantage in this market. Our service is designed to act as supplemental capacity, providing expert analysis precisely when your internal analyst bandwidth is at its limit during peak deal flow.\n\nWe apply a rigorous 6-Pillar DD Framework to ensure comprehensive coverage across Team, Technology, Tokenomics, Go-to-Market, Competitive Landscape, and Governance. This structured approach helps your firm maintain deal velocity without compromising on diligence depth.\n\nMay I ask, what is your team's current process for handling due diligence overflow when promising opportunities exceed immediate analyst capacity?"}
