{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:13:15.762853+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Thank you for the opportunity. A strong in-house team is a significant asset. We partner with funds like yours not to replace that expertise, but to provide supplemental capacity.\n\nEven the most capable teams face constraints on analyst bandwidth during peak deal flow or when an unexpected number of opportunities arise. Our service is designed to handle that overflow, ensuring your core analysts can maintain focus on the highest-priority targets without letting other promising deals slip through the cracks.\n\nThis leads to a question: how does your team currently prioritize which opportunities receive full attention when your diligence pipeline exceeds your internal research capacity?"}
