{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:14:40.744054+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "These are the right questions. Our operational leverage comes from a systematic, data-driven approach:\n\n1.  **Founder Validation:** Our methodology for founder validation integrates proprietary data sources and network graphs from prior diligence to cross-reference claims and identify undisclosed associations, moving beyond public records.\n\n2.  **Code Analysis:** Beyond commit velocity, we apply semantic analysis to code changes. This identifies the complexity and impact of contributions, distinguishing substantive feature development from minor refactoring.\n\n3.  **Data Pipeline:** Our data pipeline automates the ingestion of on-chain and off-chain sources, including vesting schedules and token events, for near real-time modeling of incentive structures.\n\nThis systematic approach is our technical edge. To help quantify the potential impact for your team, how much analyst time is currently dedicated to validating these specific data points for a single opportunity?"}
