{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:15:13.735115+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Understood. Here is our methodology:\n\n1.  **Founder Validation:** Our methodology for founder validation integrates proprietary data sources that map historical project contributions and verified outcomes. We build a contribution graph that moves beyond self-reported histories from public records alone.\n\n2.  **Code Analysis:** Beyond commit velocity, we apply semantic analysis. Our logic parses commit messages for intent, analyzes code churn to distinguish refactoring from bug-fixing, and weighs the impact of changes on core protocol logic, providing a qualitative layer over raw activity.\n\n3.  **Data Pipeline:** Our data pipeline automates the ingestion and normalization of both on-chain vesting contracts and off-chain legal documents. It uses NLP to extract key terms, creating a unified, real-time model of the cap table and incentive structure.\n\nThis systematic process is our operational leverage. How much analyst time is currently dedicated to validating these specific data points for a single target?"}
